  "The animal didn't cross the street because it was too tired"
   Para resolver "it" hay que llegar hasta "animal".

        CON RECURRENCIA                    CON ATENCION

           animal                            animal
             |                                 |
             v                                 |
           didn't                              |
             |                                 |
             v                                 |
           cross                               |
